# Soma chat's feel, with Messages as the reference (feel-messages.walk). Frame timings report and never hold anything.
# The fictional chat fixture runs production OmaChatScreen; no real sends. Prerequisite:
# -PartifactPreview :artifact-preview:assembleDebug installed on this emulator.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -S -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ei longThread 60
wait 2000
frames start dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
swipe 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.75 200
swipe 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.75 200
swipe 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.75 200
swipe 0.5 0.75 0.5 0.35 200
swipe 0.5 0.75 0.5 0.35 200
swipe 0.5 0.75 0.5 0.35 200
wait 800
frames report scroll
shot after-scroll
frames tap tabs-open Show the tabs
expect all
shot tabs-open
frames tap tabs-close Hide the tabs
frames start dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
tap ask soma
type a line to send
frames tap send Send
wait 800
frames report send
expect a line to send
shot sent
key BACK
